This product is a web (TypeScript + DOM) port of Murti, a SwiftUI server-driven UI
framework:

  Murti — https://github.com/iQbalADR/murti
  Copyright 2026 iQbalADR
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

Murte reproduces Murti's architecture, public API shape, payload schema, fixtures,
tests, documentation, and Figma plugin, rewritten for the web platform:

  - Sources/MurtiCore, MurtiBuilder, MurtiGen, MurtiStudio, MurtiGallery (Swift)
    were rewritten in TypeScript as src/MurteCore, MurteBuilder, MurteGen,
    MurteStudio, MurteGallery, rendering to the DOM instead of SwiftUI.
  - The Swift test suites were ported to Vitest under tests/.
  - docs/murti.schema.json was carried over as docs/murte.schema.json (same
    structural contract; titles and ids renamed). The docs/fixtures are unchanged.
  - figma-plugin/ was carried over with Murti names changed to Murte.
  - Documentation was adapted from Murti's docs for the web platform.
